        "text": "follow the system prompt",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=This is a real vertical smartphone video recorded in portrait mode (9:16). The camera must be physically vertical. Do NOT simulate 9:16 by rotating horizontal footage.\n\nA hyper-realistic cinematic scene of a [MAIN CHARACTER, e.g., young man in casual clothes] standing in a empty street at night.\n\nIn front of him, a glowing portal begins to form — fire ring portal. The portal emits dynamic light, reflections, and subtle particles affecting the surroundings.\n\nThe camera slowly pushes in (cinematic dolly movement). The environment reacts — [wind, dust, light flicker, objects slightly moving].\n\nThe man hesitates briefly, then suddenly runs and jumps into the portal.\n\nAs he passes through, the camera follows seamlessly into the portal (smooth transition, no cut).\n\nInside the portal: slow-motion particle stretch.\n\nThen the new world is revealed:\n\nA breathtaking golden fantasy realm appears — highly detailed, cinematic, visually stunning. The camera continues moving forward, revealing depth, scale, and atmosphere.\n\nLighting is dramatic and immersive — [sun rays, neon glow, fog, reflections, etc.]. Add environmental motion like [flying particles, moving clouds, flowing water, glowing elements].\n\nEnd with a slow cinematic reveal shot focusing on the environment.\n\nHyper-realistic, ultra-detailed, volumetric lighting, depth of field, cinematic color grading, 4K quality.\n\nNo text, no watermark.\n\nAt the end, also generate:\n- a short, casual caption not detailing everything provide a sense of mystery, not robotic (1–2 lines, slightly cryptic or curiosity-driven)\n- at most one emoji\n- include 3–5 simple, relevant hashtags only (e.g. satisfying, oddlysatisfying, asmr, aiart, loop)\n- avoid long or spammy hashtags"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
